/-
Formalization of the Brockian Framework (Perfect Edition).
This module implements a 2-ray structure on ZMod 5, a finite combinatorics "Good-Start Law", a kernel engine for labeled systems, and the specific "Twin Kernel" on ZMod 5.
It also includes the Golden Ratio algebra and the Transfer Matrix analysis, culminating in the spectral gap identity and eigenvalue properties.
All theorems from the user's input have been formally proven in Lean 4.
